    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32755" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏpisthogrăphus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπισθόγραφος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>written on the back</i> (as, <i>of the
				paper</i>, etc.), <i>opisthographic</i>
			(post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">commentarii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 3, 5, 17</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏpisthogrăphum</span></b> ,
			i, n., <i>that which has been
				written upon on the back</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">testari in opisthographo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					37, 11, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
